{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-24241","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-28219","text":"03 — Invocation Gateway"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24243","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28220","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-28221","text":" How agent invocations flow through the Edge Function gateway, including the canonical request/response shapes, authentication, limit checks, session handling, streaming, and error normalization."}]}],"id":"blk-24242","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-24244","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28222","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24245","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-28223","text":"Gateway Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-24246","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28224","text":"The invocation gateway is a Supabase Edge Function at "},{"id":"spn-28225","marks":["code"],"text":"/functions/v1/invoke/:agentId"},{"id":"spn-28226","text":". It authenticates the caller, checks plan limits, resolves the active deployment, routes to the runtime provider adapter, and returns a normalized response."}]},{"id":"blk-24247","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28227","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24248","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-28228","text":"Request Shape ("},{"id":"spn-28229","marks":["code"],"text":"InvokeRequest"},{"id":"spn-28230","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-24249","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface InvokeRequest {\n  input: {\n    messages?: Array<{\n      role: \"system\" | \"user\" | \"assistant\" | \"tool\";\n      content: string;\n    }>;\n    prompt?: string;  // converted to messages if provided\n  };\n  sessionId?: string;  // opaque; provider-specific\n  options?: {\n    maxSteps?: number;\n    temperature?: number;\n    toolPolicy?: { allow?: string[]; deny?: string[] };\n  };\n  metadata?: {\n    traceId?: string;\n    client?: string;\n  };\n}"},{"id":"blk-24250","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28231","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rule:"},{"id":"spn-28232","text":" If "},{"id":"spn-28233","marks":["code"],"text":"prompt"},{"id":"spn-28234","text":" is provided instead of "},{"id":"spn-28235","marks":["code"],"text":"messages"},{"id":"spn-28236","text":", the gateway converts it to "},{"id":"spn-28237","marks":["code"],"text":"[{ role: \"user\", content: prompt }]"},{"id":"spn-28238","text":" before forwarding."}]},{"id":"blk-24251","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28239","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24252","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-28240","text":"Response Shape ("},{"id":"spn-28241","marks":["code"],"text":"InvokeResponse"},{"id":"spn-28242","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-24253","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface InvokeResponse {\n  output: {\n    text: string;\n    messages?: Array<{ role: string; content: string }>;\n  };\n  sessionId?: string;\n  usage: {\n    tokens?: number;\n    computeMs?: number;\n    toolCalls?: number;\n  };\n  traceId: string;\n  error?: NormalizedError;\n}"},{"id":"blk-24254","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28243","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24255","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-28244","text":"Gateway Pipeline"}]},{"id":"blk-24256","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. Parse request\n2. Authenticate (Supabase Auth JWT)\n3. Load agent record (RLS-filtered)\n4. Verify agent.status === \"active\"\n5. Resolve active deployment + runtime provider\n6. Check plan limits (billing_usage vs tier limits)\n7. Generate traceId (if not provided)\n8. Route to RPI adapter: invoke(input, sessionId, options)\n9. Normalize response\n10. Return to caller"},{"id":"blk-24257","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28245","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24258","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-28246","text":"Authentication"}]},{"id":"blk-24259","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28247","text":"All invocations require a valid Supabase Auth JWT in the "},{"id":"spn-28248","marks":["code"],"text":"Authorization"},{"id":"spn-28249","text":" header:"}]},{"id":"blk-24260","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Authorization: Bearer <supabase-jwt>"},{"id":"blk-24261","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28250","text":"The gateway extracts "},{"id":"spn-28251","marks":["code"],"text":"auth.uid()"},{"id":"spn-28252","text":" and uses it to load the agent via RLS. If the agent does not belong to the caller, the query returns empty and the gateway returns "},{"id":"spn-28253","marks":["code"],"text":"NOT_FOUND"},{"id":"spn-28254","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-24262","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28255","text":"Post-MVP: per-agent API keys for public invocation."}]},{"id":"blk-24263","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28256","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24264","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-28257","text":"Limit Checks"}]},{"id":"blk-24265","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28258","text":"Before routing to the provider, the gateway checks:"}]},{"id":"blk-24266","kind":"code","language":"sql","text":"SELECT total_requests, total_tokens, total_compute_ms\nFROM billing_usage\nWHERE user_id = auth.uid()\n  AND period_key = current_period();"},{"id":"blk-24267","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28259","text":"If any metric exceeds the user's tier limit, the gateway returns "},{"id":"spn-28260","marks":["code"],"text":"LIMIT_EXCEEDED"},{"id":"spn-28261","text":" without invoking the agent."}]},{"id":"blk-24268","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28262","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24269","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-28263","text":"Session Handling"}]},{"id":"blk-24270","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24272","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28264","text":"If "},{"id":"spn-28265","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-28266","text":" is provided, it is forwarded to the provider as-is."}]}],"id":"blk-24271","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24274","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28267","text":"If absent, the provider may create a new session and return the "},{"id":"spn-28268","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-28269","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-24273","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24276","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28270","text":"The gateway treats "},{"id":"spn-28271","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-28272","text":" as "},{"id":"spn-28273","marks":["bold"],"text":"opaque"},{"id":"spn-28274","text":" -- never parses or validates it."}]}],"id":"blk-24275","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24278","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28275","text":"Session semantics are provider-specific (DO instance for Cloudflare, runtime"}]}],"id":"blk-24277","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-24279","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28276","text":"session for AgentCore)."}]},{"id":"blk-24280","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28277","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24281","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-28278","text":"Streaming"}]},{"id":"blk-24282","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28279","text":"When the provider supports streaming, the gateway uses Server-Sent Events (SSE):"}]},{"id":"blk-24283","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Content-Type: text/event-stream\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"chunk\",\"text\":\"Hello\"}\ndata: {\"type\":\"chunk\",\"text\":\" world\"}\ndata: {\"type\":\"done\",\"usage\":{\"tokens\":12,\"computeMs\":340}}"},{"id":"blk-24284","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28280","text":"When a provider does not support true streaming, the gateway MAY emulate it by returning the full response as a single chunk followed by "},{"id":"spn-28281","marks":["code"],"text":"done"},{"id":"spn-28282","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-24285","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28283","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24286","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-28284","text":"Error Normalization"}]},{"id":"blk-24287","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28285","text":"All errors are mapped to a standard code set:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-24289","spans":[{"id":"spn-28286","text":"Code"}]},{"id":"blk-24290","spans":[{"id":"spn-28287","text":"HTTP Status"}]},{"id":"blk-24291","spans":[{"id":"spn-28288","text":"Meaning"}]}],"id":"blk-24288","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-24292","spans":[{"id":"spn-28289","marks":["code"],"text":"UNAUTHENTICATED"}]},{"id":"blk-24293","spans":[{"id":"spn-28290","text":"401"}]},{"id":"blk-24294","spans":[{"id":"spn-28291","text":"Missing or invalid JWT"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24295","spans":[{"id":"spn-28292","marks":["code"],"text":"UNAUTHORIZED"}]},{"id":"blk-24296","spans":[{"id":"spn-28293","text":"403"}]},{"id":"blk-24297","spans":[{"id":"spn-28294","text":"Valid JWT but no access to this agent"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24298","spans":[{"id":"spn-28295","marks":["code"],"text":"NOT_FOUND"}]},{"id":"blk-24299","spans":[{"id":"spn-28296","text":"404"}]},{"id":"blk-24300","spans":[{"id":"spn-28297","text":"Agent does not exist (or not owned by caller)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24301","spans":[{"id":"spn-28298","marks":["code"],"text":"LIMIT_EXCEEDED"}]},{"id":"blk-24302","spans":[{"id":"spn-28299","text":"429"}]},{"id":"blk-24303","spans":[{"id":"spn-28300","text":"Plan limit reached for this period"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24304","spans":[{"id":"spn-28301","marks":["code"],"text":"DEPLOYMENT_FAILED"}]},{"id":"blk-24305","spans":[{"id":"spn-28302","text":"502"}]},{"id":"blk-24306","spans":[{"id":"spn-28303","text":"No active deployment or deployment is broken"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24307","spans":[{"id":"spn-28304","marks":["code"],"text":"RUNTIME_ERROR"}]},{"id":"blk-24308","spans":[{"id":"spn-28305","text":"502"}]},{"id":"blk-24309","spans":[{"id":"spn-28306","text":"Provider returned an error during execution"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24310","spans":[{"id":"spn-28307","marks":["code"],"text":"INVALID_REQUEST"}]},{"id":"blk-24311","spans":[{"id":"spn-28308","text":"400"}]},{"id":"blk-24312","spans":[{"id":"spn-28309","text":"Malformed input or missing required fields"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-24313","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"LIMIT_EXCEEDED\",\n    \"message\": \"Monthly request limit reached. Upgrade your plan.\",\n    \"traceId\": \"tr_abc123\"\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-24314","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28310","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rule:"},{"id":"spn-28311","text":" Error messages must be safe for display. Never include secrets or internal stack traces."}]},{"id":"blk-24315","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28312","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24316","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-28313","text":"Rate Limiting"}]},{"id":"blk-24317","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28314","text":"The gateway SHOULD enforce per-user and per-agent rate limits beyond plan quotas:"}]},{"id":"blk-24318","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24320","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28315","text":"Per-user: max N requests/second across all agents"}]}],"id":"blk-24319","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24322","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28316","text":"Per-agent: max M requests/second per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-24321","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24324","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28317","text":"Payload size: max 1 MB request body"}]}],"id":"blk-24323","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-24325","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28318","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24326","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-28319","text":"Checklist"}]},{"id":"blk-24327","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24329","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28320","text":"[ ] Every invocation is authenticated via Supabase Auth JWT"}]}],"id":"blk-24328","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24331","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28321","text":"[ ] Agent status is verified as "},{"id":"spn-28322","marks":["code"],"text":"active"},{"id":"spn-28323","text":" before routing"}]}],"id":"blk-24330","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24333","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28324","text":"[ ] Plan limits are checked before invoking the provider"}]}],"id":"blk-24332","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24335","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28325","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-28326","marks":["code"],"text":"traceId"},{"id":"spn-28327","text":" is generated or forwarded on every request"}]}],"id":"blk-24334","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24337","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28328","text":"[ ] Errors are normalized to the standard code set"}]}],"id":"blk-24336","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24339","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28329","text":"[ ] Error messages never contain secrets or internal details"}]}],"id":"blk-24338","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24341","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28330","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-28331","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-28332","text":" is treated as opaque"}]}],"id":"blk-24340","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24343","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28333","text":"[ ] Streaming uses SSE format when supported"}]}],"id":"blk-24342","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24345","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-28334","text":"[ ] Request payload size is validated"}]}],"id":"blk-24344","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieran2kabgxewbpvg6ve5gip7pgaj5r3dz6i4u33h5w7j2nucubmmyra","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}